{"v":2,"name":"e2e-panel-click","description":"A click in the Orca sidebar panel puts the focused pane on a key through both shipped plugins: the panel asks plugin A, A sends assignKey over the bridge, B maps the pane and answers pairResult, and the key shows it. A key that shows a pane then needs replace, a pane that is on another key moves (the old key empties), Unmap empties a key, and a pane the panel names (not the focused one) goes on the key, or is refused as noSuchPane when it is gone. Revert check: drop the assignKey handler in plugin B (plugin.ts): the click answers timeout.","sides":["e2e"],"keys":{"1":"a"}}
